# shop.db — Plague Doctor's Stock
# Format: item_id | buy_price | sell_multiplier | stock
# stock: -1 = unlimited, 0 = sold out, N = finite quantity
# sell_multiplier defaults to 0.5 if omitted

# ── Consumables (unlimited stock) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
health_potion|50|0.5|-1
antidote|30|0.5|-1
smelling_salts|20|0.4|-1
bandage|15|0.4|-1

# ── Specialty items (finite stock, resets per run / save) ─────────────────────
plague_tonic|120|0.6|5
surgeons_needle|80|0.5|3
laudanum|200|0.5|2

# ── Vendor trash (can sell to doctor, not in buy list) ────────────────────────
# To make an item sell-only, don't list it here; the player can still sell it
# and receives a 0g price (doctor won't take it).  Add it with buy_price=0
# to let the doctor accept it at the sell_multiplier rate:
wolf_pelt|0|0.3|-1
